# What to focus on

## Data loss and broken sessions (one PR)

Plan: `docs/reviews/2026-10-17-data-loss-plan.md`. Audit: section 3 of `docs/reviews/2026-10-17-codebase-audit.md`.

- [x] D1: Read session files with `bufio.Reader` so lines over 64 KiB load and list. Log skipped files.
- [x] D6: Group replayed tool results into one message. Compaction steps back over all `RoleTool` messages.
- [x] D3: Repair a `tool_use` with no result on load. Save steer-skipped results to JSONL and the TUI.
- [x] D8: `Writer.Err()` reports write errors. Show "session not saved" in the TUI.
- [x] D9: `Emit` after `Close` drops the event instead of panicking.
- [x] D2: Unique child IDs (`<parentID>-sub-N`). Hide children from resume lists. Load children as read-only views when resuming the parent.
- [x] D5: Streams that end early are errors (Anthropic with no `message_stop`, OpenAI with no `[DONE]` and no `finish_reason`, `Turn` with no `TurnDone`). Show a notice on `max_tokens` or `length`.
- [x] D4: Validate tool-call JSON. Do not run invalid calls. Anthropic request builder falls back to `{}`.
- [x] D7: Do not apply a compaction summary after cancel or an early stream end.
- [x] Docs: mark D1-D9 fixed in the audit, and fix the stale comments in `load.go`, `list.go` and `spawn.go`.
